description "Boba Fett

^9Weapons:
- Melee
- Frag Grenade (2)

^3Abilities:
- Wrist Flamethrower ^3[CS2]
- Wrist Laser ^3[CS3]
- Jetpack ^3[Hold/2x Jump]

^8Attributes:
- Fuel (3) 
^2-- Regen: 20/120s
- Beskar (2)
- Healing (2)
- Blast Armor
- Brawler Guard
- Knockdown Roll
- Tracking Beacon
^2- Knockback Taken: .9x

One of the most fearsome and capable bounty hunters in the galaxy, with some of the deadliest weapons and tech at his disposal."